  "description": "If you're going to buy a 26\" dirt jump/park machine, you might want to get it from the brand that invented the kind of riding you're into. Encompassing over 30 years worth of BMX knowledge, our 1.1 is equally adept at destroying trails or killing it at parks. Full 4130 chromoly frame (with an integrated internal head tube), chromoly forks and chromoly cranks give you a perfect start to creating your own dream machine.\nFull 4130 chromoly frame w/ internal head tube, Euro BB shell, and horizontal dropouts\nFull 4130 chromoly fork with 31.8mm legs, suspension corrected\nAvailable in two sizes: Short (21.8\" TT) and Long (22.3\" TT)\nThree-piece chromoly 175mm 8-spline cranks w/ 25t sprocket\nWeinmann ZAC 19 double-wall rims\nTektro IO mechanical disc brake with 6\" rotor\nKenda K-Rad 2.3\" tires",
